<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="7db00b45">&lt;p&gt;
    Update the issue log with a summary of all newly identified issues. Use it to view open issues, track those that have
    been deferred, and make sure that issues requiring resolution are resolved.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    The log should contain enough information so that issues are not overlooked, and yet not so much information that
    scanning becomes difficult.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
